  "notable_quotes": [
    "The paper proposes that stronger simultaneous interactions with C2H2 and C2H6 than with C2H4 are key for one-step C2H4 purification from C2 mixtures.",
    "GCMC simulations attribute NTUniv-59's C2H2-over-C2H4 preference to multiple hydrogen-bonding interactions between amino groups and C2H2.",
    "Slight functional-group changes strongly affected C2H4 separation capacity, showing high sensitivity of separation to pore-surface chemistry."
